---
layout: base.njk
title: 夜话
---

<div style="
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 7em 1.5em 4em;
">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section style="margin-bottom: 4em; text-align: center;">
    <h1 class="fade-in-strong hero-title" style="
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.3em;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    ">久远寺邸</h1>
    <p class="fade-in hero-sub" style="
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    ">——坂之上、红屋顶的洋馆。其间栖息着两位魔女。</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Posts -->
  <section>
    {% set posts = collections.posts | reverse %}
    {% if posts | length %}
      {% for post in posts %}
      <a href="{{ post.url | url }}" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block; margin-bottom: 1.5em;">
        <article class="glass post-entry fade-in" style="
          padding: 1.5em 2em;
          cursor: pointer;
          transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        "
        tabindex="0"
        role="link"
        >
          <h2 style="
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin: 0 0 0.4em;
          ">
            <span style="
              color: var(--text-primary);
              border-bottom: none;
              text-decoration: none;
            ">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          </h2>

          {% if post.data.date %}
          <p style="
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6em;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
          ">
            <time class="post-date" datetime="{{ post.data.date }}">{{ post.data.date }}</time>
          </p>
          {% endif %}

          {% if post.data.description %}
          <p style="
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 0;
          ">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    {% else %}
      <!-- 🔮 极富魔力沉浸感的空白占位 -->
      <div class="glass fade-in" style="
        padding: 4em 2em;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--text-muted);
      ">
        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.8em; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
          「 结界静默，尚未寻得岁月的刻印。 」
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          于山丘的迷雾之中（在 <code>src/posts/</code> 目录下谱写新的诗篇）<br />以叩开洋馆沉重的大门。
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</div>

<style>
  .post-entry:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 28px var(--shadow-color);
  }
  .post-entry h2 a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
</style>
